- Create a derivative standard using the PhysMCP name

Third-party hardware and software may implement the PhysMCP specification
freely under the CC-BY-SA 4.0 and Apache 2.0 licenses above. However,
use of the "PhysMCP" name or certification mark on such products requires
participation in the PhysMCP certification program.

For trademark inquiries: contact@physmcp.org

